        "value": "demuxer_backbuffer",
        "display_name": "Demuxer Back Buffer",
        "help": "Controls how much already-played data mpv keeps for instant backward seeks, in MB. Larger values use more memory. The default matches mpv's 50 MB (10 MB on Raspberry Pi).",
